{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2021-12", "window": 2, "start_date": 1638921600, "end_date": 1639612799, "month_true_total": 425, "quota": 7, "returned": 7, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:19:53 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "105893194", "author": {"steamid": "76561198348546866", "personaname": "SUPREME YEET", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198348546866/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 81, "playtime_forever": 4926, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3424, "last_played": 1689133198, "avatar": "f60c1a9b0b5a0ace3c3a47916a3fcadc8d5f2e10"}, "language": "english", "review": "Edit: with the new crossplay system this game is now back to its glory with easily found matches with under an minute match times. new content and a prestige system greatly improves the replayability of the game. \n\n\nSadly the matchmaking system and the lack of replay value killed this game and turned players away from what could have been a great game if they added new stuff", "timestamp_created": 1639608703, "timestamp_updated": 1658882902, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.622373640537261963", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "105893191", "author": {"steamid": "76561198358270220", "personaname": "ickis", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Ickus/", "num_games_owned": 102, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 379, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 379, "last_played": 1631751911, "avatar": "d58444dca56aa7ccc0c4497ce2b9b9d75e0a04f8"}, "language": "english", "review": "its an odd reskin of Star Wars Battlefront 2.  It requires multiplayer to move the campaign forward and with such a small player base and no re-playability you will likely not find anyone to play with.  The game is dead.  \n\nMusic soundtrack is also horrible.  Its like the cantina music from starwars when it should be ominous its like goofy. \n\nI would not recommend this game and I am a big fan of the Alien franchise.", "timestamp_created": 1639608699, "timestamp_updated": 1639608699, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.517709314823150635", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "105892517", "author": {"steamid": "76561198285554050", "personaname": "whisky", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/secret50/", "num_games_owned": 169, "num_reviews": 58, "playtime_forever": 380, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 32, "last_played": 1730571104, "avatar": "c7620482e7d5d4a11bdd6ea5f863bae19bb796d0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Almost made it through my first mission, but it got bugged and it ruined my whole mood. Overall game is fun, but I don't have the energy to complete the same mission again and risk doing it again just to meet another bug. A alien spawned inside a wall, and we had to kill it for the mission to be complete, there was nothing to do.", "timestamp_created": 1639607558, "timestamp_updated": 1639607558, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.475575506687164307", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "105891791", "author": {"steamid": "76561197961650056", "personaname": "KillapleX", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/killaplex/", "num_games_owned": 965, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 1718, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 211, "last_played": 1689367451, "avatar": "2849a3667ab23509e0ba1486d4641ea5d4fbf93e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Its what Aliens : colonial marines should have been.\nQuick shooting alien actions with all the guns, sounds and aliens from the movies and other games.\n\nBut i will say it gets a little repetitive after a few missions and i don't understand why they decided to go with teams of 3 rather than 4 like most games?", "timestamp_created": 1639606378, "timestamp_updated": 1639606378, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.518518567085266113", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "105890850", "author": {"steamid": "76561198985758097", "personaname": "SlickRhoads", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198985758097/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 3888, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3055, "last_played": 1670976485, "avatar": "f0fd1c1198b987cd7dd47d78daf600463fbcb0ab"}, "language": "english", "review": "Exceeded my expectations. It's fun to play and sounds great, too. If you like the movie Aliens (1987), and want to shoot aliens yourself, this is the game for you. My only complaint is the horde mode needs more maps. Can't wait for more content!", "timestamp_created": 1639604875, "timestamp_updated": 1639604875, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_da